"""RFI list for the Hollywood Comedy Club bid (Kelly Architects 2604), de-duplicated across
mep_notes.md, equipment_notes.md, demo_struct_gc_notes.md, pricing2_notes.md and
equipment_web_prices_notes.md. Nothing here is invented: every question traces to a conflict,
missing document or unreadable cell named in those notes (source_note_file column).

Fields: no, sheets, discipline, category, subject, question, why, importance, sources, suggestion
Importance: High = scope of more than one trade or a major system cannot be priced;
            Med = one trade / one system cannot be priced or quantified;
            Low = quantity or product detail, small bid effect.
"""

